      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "运行时主路径",
      "items": [
        "语音回合: 麦 → ASR 转写 → LLM 流式 → 句切 → TTS → 边下边播",
        "打断: VAD speech_start → barge-in 三动作 <50ms",
        "LLM 不走 momo-ws, 独立 OpenAI-compatible HTTP"
      ]
    },
