      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "运维面",
      "items": [
        "momoctl web: 组件起停 / 模型激活 / 训练 job / env 配置",
        "训练 pipeline: voice-sft 与 persona-qlora, 产物登记进 MANIFEST",
        "同一 job store, CLI 与 Web 共享"
      ]
    },
